    "note": "So the cabinet stood, and stands: Monday, the Amber (Sun); Tuesday, the Lead-white (Saturn); Wednesday, the Ultramarine (Moon); Thursday, the Verdigris (Venus); Friday, the Ochre (Jupiter); Saturday, the Crimson (Mars); Sunday, the Bone (Mercury). And Saturday's drawer held the Crimson — iron, Mars's metal. The cabinet keeps its own order; the almanac may see to its own."
